      "category": "culture",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The Helix Bridge, a steel‑swinging pedestrian link, was finished in 2010 and connects Bayfront to Marina Centre, symbolizing modern engineering.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
